    [Doc] Fix section 7.1 import path and section numbering rendering error (#19607)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Fix two documentation issues:
    1. Correct the incorrect import path in section 7.1, which would lead to
    import errors if users run the sample code.
    2. Fix the section numbering rendering error that causes wrong display
    of document serial numbers.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No, this is a documentation-only fix.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    Verified the corrected import path and previewed the rendered document
    locally to confirm the numbering displays correctly.
    
